{"ascii": "Deb Cooley", "ascii_short": "", "biography": "Retired Senior Cryptographic Vulnerability Analyst, National Security Agency Cybersecurity Directorate (NSA/CSD) with 37+ years of service in Dec 2023.  Most of Deb’s career was spent as a security evaluator on many different technologies including IP encryptors, satellites, radios, and key management devices.\r\n\r\nPreviously, Special Government Expert for the Department of Homeland Security, Cybersecurity and Infrastructure Security Agency’s Cyber Security Division.  \r\nPreviously, acme working group chair.", "id": 123703, "name": "Deb Cooley", "name_from_draft": null, "photo": "https://www.ietf.org/lib/dt/media/photo/Deb_Cooley_Portrait1.jpg", "photo_thumb": "https://www.ietf.org/lib/dt/media/photo/Deb_Cooley_Portrait1_q1wynIh.jpg", "plain": "", "pronouns_freetext": null, "pronouns_selectable": "['she/her']", "resource_uri": "/api/v1/person/person/123703/", "time": "2017-09-07T07:17:11Z", "user": ""}